{"id":"a33c8556d30df82b0e957bbb51b49f0c2670ded95106955d1b168e03050fafdd","at":"2026-10-28T19:23:57Z","commit":"fbebb80bb625b3e80e457f9e65df6e4b80224383","parents":["b572cbf5586b8d87efa4ba354566cf7a180d6eddf21b18844f9fea31bce0803d"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Data.DerivedTest: joined fields: each output field but identity as id.field, nil without an entry","hash":"6f0a8af6"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/02-derived.md#derived-join-fields","hash":"6dacd391"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"each row gains the output's non-identity field as id.field (health.state ok), nil where its entity has no output row; the joined schema describes it as the output does and omits the identity (health.host); no outputs leaves rows unchanged. The no-atom claim moved to its own test (macaw_data#1)","basis":"review"}
{"id":"4f8b6ec74540a895d667c655d66911c768653acc129d57c40c1bd74ca478796a","at":"2026-10-28T19:24:01Z","commit":"fbebb80bb625b3e80e457f9e65df6e4b80224383","parents":["a8ac6d4b73e26a598d86844efaa835403f91b627c5305091f991bdaf3b368f53"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Data.DerivedTest: joining makes no atom of an output's id, its fields or the joined names","hash":"1548350e"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/02-derived.md#derived-join-fields","hash":"6dacd391"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"an output with a fresh id and field joins as id.field, the joined schema holds id.field, and neither the id, the field, id.field nor id.host is an atom after join/3 and schema/2: the clause \"no atom is made\"","basis":"review"}
{"id":"649520d6fc69ff8b2eb635ffdcd6ca0c705094b73cd8c2e4978fd4a10eeee74f","at":"2026-10-28T19:24:05Z","commit":"fbebb80bb625b3e80e457f9e65df6e4b80224383","parents":["13d61147959729fb89067b1c34324fb83931c5c9d4fd13cada6a3fba4d762a54"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Data.SchemaAtomsTest: reading a schema's JSON makes no atom, of a name, a state, a role or an unknown word","hash":"e5126d2a"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/01-sources.md#schema-json-read","hash":"50c23065"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"from_json/1 reads a document spelling a field name, an order state, a status label, a second name, an unknown type word and an unknown key, all fresh; none of the six is an atom after: no atom is made from a document","basis":"review"}
